<view class="page team-join-page"><view class="join-hero"><view class="join-hero-copy"><view class="join-kicker">给你的轻盈邀请</view><view class="join-heading">一个人走很快，<view>一起走得更远。</view></view><view class="join-subtitle">和伙伴一起坚持记录</view></view><view class="join-hero-glow"></view><image class="join-trophy" src="/images/home/shortcuts/rank.png" mode="aspectFit"/><image class="join-people" src="/images/home/shortcuts/team.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="join-card"><view class="join-card-title">加入好友的小队</view><view class="join-form-label">邀请码</view><input class="join-code-input" value="{{code}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="粘贴好友分享的邀请码"/><button class="join-view-button" bindtap="viewInvite" disabled="{{busy || !code}}">查看邀请</button><view wx:if="{{invitation}}" class="join-details"><view class="join-team-name">{{invitation.name}}</view><view class="join-detail-line">{{invitation.city}} · {{invitation.memberCount}} / {{invitation.max}} 人</view><view class="join-detail-line">{{invitation.start}} 至 {{invitation.end}}</view><view class="join-detail-line">{{invitation.launched?'挑战进行中':'正在召集伙伴'}}</view><button wx:if="{{invitation.alreadyJoined}}" class="btn mt" bindtap="openTeam">已加入，查看我的小队</button><button wx:else class="btn mt" bindtap="join" disabled="{{busy}}">加入这个小队</button></view></view><button class="join-help" bindtap="rules">小队挑战怎么玩？再看一遍说明</button><view class="join-privacy">加入后展示昵称与小队整体完成率，不公开体重和餐食照片。</view></view>